{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a charming pixel art world where managing your farm becomes a constantly evolving adventure. Start with limited resources and transform your land into a thriving agricultural enterprise through crops, livestock, and impressive constructions like windmills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the seasons change and the map expands, unlock new possibilities to upgrade and automate your activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484080/extras/Capsula_Intestazione.png?t=1740777242\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building and management</strong>: Create your farm starting from crops, livestock, and advanced structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic progression</strong>: Unlock new areas and features as your farm grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seasonal variations</strong>: Adapt your strategies to the changing seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging interaction</strong>: Speed up production by clicking on constructions to gather resources faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades and Automation</strong>: Make your operations more efficient with enhanced buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple controls</strong>: Move the camera with WASD and interact through point-and-click.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484080?t=1740777242","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740777242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484080/0ef2e701dc612ebd58686b10ea5947fa97ac1e49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740777242","capsule_ima